, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Uspu_q24lIoQ7kNvwFGMJw5&_nc_oc=AdoYO_XR7GY3cjxap0Dm2LWmldL6WTNbPIbZkMySqDFGwXh4GcejauLFednH-c69rCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS-a-64mgkUOlB1XN0Bw9KzmsCYz-229-9EQ_kDwmNNsg&oe=6B048277"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E1At1vFyqzwQ7kNvwHVtGlj&_nc_oc=AdpHPh6cU8qjOMJByzGMSIGy0ALyFfrtHYp4u5VjZlc_j4ve2UoKORsmokORSNvJpB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdkXzRYwIiePwK1V9bTRrzSU20FgJrqu-DNuIerbxP4Q&oe=6B04840A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3fzTCUSxZN0Q7kNvwFjBYYD&_nc_oc=AdqoArhFvaBRtnPOulryrJ_C5EDa2auNTunQg77GV29VubSjf52UrMH0hfIpVcbpJY0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSujkvuoHqe2Qvt-mHqZfC6m0jGyT3kxerd054NtE_wag&oe=6B04712F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DRKxqaeo7SwQ7kNvwF_x9a8&_nc_oc=AdouYaurvydvthLg5FKhbIWzZBdQiu63eox3x8yhfsysSO_zzGpIzQ2CJc2VOQvA3C0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRMKJJWxlpUbKhJ3DwUi1Dha7u-5GB8fU2mtPZYJ9gd5A&oe=6B045A83"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_tPmRokOk-0Q7kNvwG_hPG7&_nc_oc=Adr23mgSJkMFXP34CtRQLAFRepQ-ChbpBUclTyx8XCps8BC_O9874M6PAJVdPlgKOdo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ4f_9VrMFjBvtm6HkmgnuasmNiznBh8RvJNzXXShzIsg&oe=6B0452D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tYhjGdOyiUwQ7kNvwHZSL9U&_nc_oc=AdoThDkZVHX_tsc7FALn7lJgMZStVpEjp_